---
name: French 75
ingredients:
  - type: Gin
    amount: '1'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Lemon juice
    amount: 1/2
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Simple syrup
    amount: 1/2
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Champagne or other sparkling wine
    amount: '3'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Lemon
    amount: '1'
    unit: twist
    garnish: true
category:
  - sparkling
  - gin
image: ../../images/cocktails/french-75/image.jpg
sourceUrl: https://www.liquor.com/recipes/french-75-2/
---
1. Add the gin, lemon juice and simple syrup to a shaker with ice and shake until well-chilled.
1. Strain into a Champagne flute.
1. Top with the Champagne or sparkling wine of choice.
1. Garnish with a lemon twist.
